      "@id": "docs/concepts/architecture/migration-plan.md#provenance-1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "issue",
      "cat-harness:section": "(header)",
      "prov:value": "> **Status: proposed, nothing started.** This plan is the deliverable of\n> [issue #223](https://github.com/litlfred/folio-assistant/issues/223). It is\n> written to be argued with before any code moves.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/concepts/architecture/migration-plan.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "The governing principle",
      "prov:value": "Every boundary this migration creates is an\nopportunity to reproduce the defect `AGENTS.md` records from qou commit\n`39fc90f6`: a script deleted while its hook reference survived, or a path\ncomputed from a script's own location that was correct before a split and wrong\nafter.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "qou commit 39fc90f6",
        "AGENTS.md"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/concepts/architecture/migration-plan.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "The governing principle",
      "prov:value": "Bean `dh4f` is the measured cost of that defect at the *last* split: 30 scripts\ntriaged, 23 broken, and three of them —",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean dh4f"
      ]
    },
    {
